(*UTF)    PCRE option or verb (*UTF)
(?m)      flags: turns on multiline from here to the end of the group
^         start of a line (m flag)
a         "a" literally (case-insensitive)
(?-i)     flags: turns off case-insensitive from here to the end of the group
b         "b" literally
$         end of a line (m flag)
(?#note)  comment (ignored)
(*SKIP)   if the rest fails, skip ahead to this position for the next try
(?>…)     atomic group (no backtracking into it)
└─ x      "x" literally
(?<n>…)   named group "n"
└─ y      "y" literally
\k<n>     same text as group "n" (#1)
